{"packet_id":"D009-01","doc_id":"D009","jurisdiction":"Berkeley, CA","category":"rent_increase_limits","lifecycle":"enacted","title":"Berkeley rent control coverage by unit type","requirement":"Rent control covers most multifamily units built before 1980, single-family homes with tenancies begun before 1996, and rooming houses with five or more rooms. Units built and receiving a certificate of occupancy after June 1980 are registered but not rent-controlled.","key_value":null,"coverage_conditions":"Rent control applies to units in multifamily properties built before 1980, single-family homes with tenancies begun before 1996, and rooming houses with five or more rooms; post-June-1980 construction, condominiums and post-1996 single-family tenancies are not rent-controlled.","applicability":{"built_on_or_before":"1980","built_after":null,"date_basis":"certificate_of_occupancy","min_units":null,"max_units":null,"owner_dependent":true,"other":"Multifamily built before 1980; single-family tenancies begun before 1996; rooming houses with 5+ rooms"},"exemptions":"Golden Duplex owner-occupied on December 31, 1979 with an owner still living in one unit; unit where the owner shares a kitchen or bath and lived on the property when the tenancy started; tenancies started after Nov 7, 2018 where one unit is an ADU and either unit is owner-occupied; university rental units such as dormitories; nonprofit cooperatives.","penalty":null,"effective_date":null,"citation":"Berkeley Rent Stabilization and Eviction for Just Cause Ordinance","quoted_span":"Most units in multifamily properties built before 1980** Fully Covered Yes Yes Yes Yes","interaction":null,"confidence":0.75,"conflict_flag":false,"conflict_note":null}
